{"id":11796,"date":"2026-10-22T14:18:05","date_gmt":"2026-10-22T12:18:05","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/radyz.cz\/?p=11796"},"modified":"2026-10-22T21:18:26","modified_gmt":"2026-10-22T19:18:26","slug":"histor-otevrel-dataset-zmen-nastroju-mcp-nikoli-seznam-skodlivych-serveru","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/radyz.cz\/rychle-zpravy\/histor-otevrel-dataset-zmen-nastroju-mcp-nikoli-seznam-skodlivych-serveru\/","title":{"rendered":"HISTOR otev\u0159el dataset zm\u011bn n\u00e1stroj\u016f MCP, nikoli seznam \u0161kodliv\u00fdch server\u016f"},"content":{"rendered":"<p>Projekt HISTOR zp\u0159\u00edstupnil dataset definic n\u00e1stroj\u016f MCP a jejich zm\u011bn. Snapshot z 20. \u0159\u00edjna obsahuje p\u0159es 81 tis\u00edc evidovan\u00fdch server\u016f a bal\u00ed\u010dk\u016f a t\u00e9m\u011b\u0159 24 tis\u00edc zaznamenan\u00fdch zm\u011bn. U vzd\u00e1len\u00fdch server\u016f sleduje deklarovan\u00e9 n\u00e1stroje, u bal\u00ed\u010dk\u016f npm a PyPI je z\u00edsk\u00e1v\u00e1 spu\u0161t\u011bn\u00edm v sandboxu. Data lze pou\u017e\u00edt ke studiu toho, jak se rozhran\u00ed n\u00e1stroj\u016f pro AI agenty vyv\u00edjej\u00ed.<\/p>\n<p>Soubory obsahuj\u00ed definice, historii zm\u011bn i v\u00fdsledky pomocn\u00fdch kontrol a maj\u00ed zve\u0159ejn\u011bn\u00e9 kontroln\u00ed sou\u010dty a podepsan\u00fd manifest. Dataset je dostupn\u00fd pod CC BY 4.0. Auto\u0159i v\u00fdslovn\u011b varuj\u00ed, \u017ee zm\u011bna definice ani shoda s podez\u0159el\u00fdm vzorem nedokazuje \u0161kodlivost serveru. Z\u00e1znam nav\u00edc ukazuje pouze to, co server zp\u0159\u00edstupnil p\u0159i dan\u00e9m dotazu, ne jeho skute\u010dn\u00e9 chov\u00e1n\u00ed.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>HISTOR otev\u0159el dataset zm\u011bn n\u00e1stroj\u016f MCP, nikoli seznam \u0161kodliv\u00fdch server\u016f.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":11807,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"_rz_audio_url":"","footnotes":""},"categories":[39],"tags":[28,45,37],"class_list":["post-11796","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-rychle-zpravy","tag-ai","tag-bezpecnost","tag-novinky"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/radyz.cz\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/11796","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/radyz.cz\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/radyz.cz\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/radyz.cz\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/radyz.cz\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=11796"}],"version-history":[{"count":2,"href":"https:\/\/radyz.cz\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/11796\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":11947,"href":"https:\/\/radyz.cz\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/11796\/revisions\/11947"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/radyz.cz\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/11807"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/radyz.cz\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=11796"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/radyz.cz\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/categories?post=11796"},{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/radyz.cz\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=11796"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}